{"unit_id":"Lucky020__dsh-delivery-kit#card-zh","repo":"Lucky020/dsh-delivery-kit","commit":"f3016f90e8bc6de026bc28a245ea3114786a1a45","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-delivery-kit 是面向 DSH 的交付文档工具，提供交付文档目录与文档生成工具。它扫描给定项目的代码结构、路由和模型，并将材料组织成 Word 文档。主要能力包括整理可生成文档及所需材料、从 ORM 模型生成数据库设计说明书、根据 SQL/CSV/JSON 结构生成数据库文档，以及按页面清单生成使用说明书并可自动截图。适合需要准备项目设计和验收材料的开发与交付人员。需要本机 Node.js 22 以上、Python 与 python-docx；自动截图还需要 Chrome。目录中有些文档类型暂未实现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-19","lib/delivery/tools.js:315-353","lib/delivery/docs/database.js:1-5","lib/delivery/tools.js:327-350"]}
{"unit_id":"Lucky020__dsh-delivery-kit#card-en","repo":"Lucky020/dsh-delivery-kit","commit":"f3016f90e8bc6de026bc28a245ea3114786a1a45","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-delivery-kit creates delivery documents from code and schemas. It lists options, generates database designs from ORM models or SQL/CSV/JSON, and builds user manuals with screenshots. Word output needs Python and python-docx; screenshots need Chrome. Some types are unfinished.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-19","lib/delivery/tools.js:315-353","lib/delivery/docs/database.js:1-5","lib/delivery/tools.js:327-350"]}
